# Next.js 16 auto-generates these on every `next dev` run (see
# node_modules/next/dist/server/lib/generate-agent-files.js) — not
# hand-authored project docs, so don't track the regenerated copies.
# This project's real Claude Code memory file is CLAUDE.local.md (untracked
# by default anyway) plus whatever's in .claude/ — see HANDOFF.md instead
# for cross-session continuity notes.
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md
